{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Polly's Gone</i> is a unique blend of action-RTS and shoot'em up elements, where you embark on a journey to find the missing Polly, joined by a loyal team of sheep. Progress through levels, face new challenges, and overcome dangers to get closer to uncovering Polly's whereabouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Polly's Gone</i> offers two exciting game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/5db964a65f3099a30c5c5fd6f0900205.poster.avif?t=1760027189\" width=640 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/5db964a65f3099a30c5c5fd6f0900205.webm?t=1760027189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/5db964a65f3099a30c5c5fd6f0900205.mp4?t=1760027189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Dive into the story and explore various levels while tactically guiding your team and defeating enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/f1124332f4b935304b3fd9a2853f2b8c.poster.avif?t=1760027189\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/f1124332f4b935304b3fd9a2853f2b8c.webm?t=1760027189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/f1124332f4b935304b3fd9a2853f2b8c.mp4?t=1760027189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong>: Test your skills in a challenging 10-minute survival arena on a lost island, where your team\u2019s fate rests in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for dynamic battles, unique environments, and thrilling challenges in this action-packed adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358030?t=1760027189","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/37b651895212d1d0f9ab07fe5e183ad0a68d2416/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760027189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/3c98c6c73ed7eabb6d8d7fc5308a152dab993089/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760027189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/3c98c6c73ed7eabb6d8d7fc5308a152dab993089/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760027189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game shows the death of low polygon animals, but no animal was injured during the making of the game."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Polly's Gone</i> is a unique blend of action-RTS and shoot'em up elements, where you embark on a journey to find the missing Polly, joined by a loyal team of sheep. Progress through levels, face new challenges, and overcome dangers to get closer to uncovering Polly's whereabouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Polly's Gone</i> offers two exciting game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.